{"3230030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaos of Destiny Remake", "steam_appid": 3230030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Purchase Offer!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is about to begin! ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos of Destiny Remake is coming to <strong>Early Access</strong>, and we want to invite you to be a part of this adventure from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕹️ Why join now?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in the development by providing your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be among the first to experience new mechanics, items, and never-before-seen content from the remake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the best part! <strong>If you purchase during Early Access, you'll get a 20% discount off the final price.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 This offer is only available during the Early Access phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Join the community, share your ideas, and help shape the future of Chaos of Destiny Remake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face Team Prism, discover the hidden secrets of this world, and defy the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Get your early copy today and save 20%.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos of Destiny Remake</strong> is a <strong>turn-based RPG</strong> with a <strong>dark atmosphere</strong> where you must face the <strong>tyrannical Prisma Team</strong> and <strong>monsters born from the darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>cities, villages, and dungeons</strong>, <strong>craft items</strong> through <strong>alchemy recipes</strong>, and <strong>uncover secrets</strong> hidden after the <strong>fall of the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a story filled with <strong>peculiar characters</strong>, <strong>formidable enemies</strong>, and a <strong>protagonist</strong> marked by a <strong>past</strong> the game itself tries to <strong>conceal</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Classic turn-based combat</strong> with <strong>skills, magic, and strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Recipe and alchemy system</strong> to make use of <strong>hundreds of items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Exploration of a world in chaos</strong>, with <strong>cities protected by walls</strong> and <strong>places corrupted by darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Unique characters</strong> like <strong>Catty</strong> or <strong>Kortana</strong>, who will surely make your <strong>experience memorable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ More than <strong>800 items</strong>, <strong>secrets</strong>, and <strong>fourth-wall-breaking events</strong> that are part of the <strong>experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 A <strong>varied soundtrack</strong> with music from <strong>different composers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Your choices</strong> will <strong>shape the story</strong>, affecting <strong>relationships with characters</strong>, <strong>events</strong>, and <strong>potential paths</strong>. <strong>Every decision</strong> can lead to <strong>unexpected consequences</strong>, making <strong>each playthrough</strong> a <strong>unique experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chaos of Destiny is designed to play with you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It’s not a glitch. It’s the game protecting itself from you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Monsters don’t always attack. Sometimes they just watch.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Survive. But don’t trust reality.&quot;</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos of Destiny Remake</strong> is a <strong>turn-based RPG</strong> with a <strong>dark atmosphere</strong> where you must face the <strong>tyrannical Prisma Team</strong> and <strong>monsters born from the darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>cities, villages, and dungeons</strong>, <strong>craft items</strong> through <strong>alchemy recipes</strong>, and <strong>uncover secrets</strong> hidden after the <strong>fall of the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a story filled with <strong>peculiar characters</strong>, <strong>formidable enemies</strong>, and a <strong>protagonist</strong> marked by a <strong>past</strong> the game itself tries to <strong>conceal</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Classic turn-based combat</strong> with <strong>skills, magic, and strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Recipe and alchemy system</strong> to make use of <strong>hundreds of items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Exploration of a world in chaos</strong>, with <strong>cities protected by walls</strong> and <strong>places corrupted by darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Unique characters</strong> like <strong>Catty</strong> or <strong>Kortana</strong>, who will surely make your <strong>experience memorable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ More than <strong>800 items</strong>, <strong>secrets</strong>, and <strong>fourth-wall-breaking events</strong> that are part of the <strong>experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 A <strong>varied soundtrack</strong> with music from <strong>different composers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 <strong>Your choices</strong> will <strong>shape the story</strong>, affecting <strong>relationships with characters</strong>, <strong>events</strong>, and <strong>potential paths</strong>. <strong>Every decision</strong> can lead to <strong>unexpected consequences</strong>, making <strong>each playthrough</strong> a <strong>unique experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chaos of Destiny is designed to play with you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It’s not a glitch. It’s the game protecting itself from you.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Monsters don’t always attack. Sometimes they just watch.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Survive. But don’t trust reality.&quot;</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Collect, craft, explore, defeat powerful enemies, forge your own weapons, customize your equipment, complete dungeons, solve puzzles and dominate the terrain in this grand open world RPG focused on a retro yet innovative experience.", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230030/881f6f193a22c1b68a1990a1c19876ba446d57bf/header.jpg?t=1782741568", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230030/cea1f79e18d29be689bbf7b7cd79da043bc28af7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782741568", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230030/cea1f79e18d29be689bbf7b7cd79da043bc28af7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782741568", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 7/8/8.1/10 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb